t=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ebdf1022-bb30-4a03-ac29-82f488bfce4f</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ebdf1022-bb30-4a03-ac29-82f488bfce4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ebdf1022-bb30-4a03-ac29-82f488bfce4f\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/38px-Warning_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Warning Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Warning_Icon.png/25px-Warning_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Warning_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <span style=\"color: #EB2C60;\">Not usable by humanoids.</span></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-288&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-167</span>: Leaning against the southern wall</li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_(creature)\" title=\"Steel Watcher (creature)